    "title": "2026 Masters payout, prize money: How much money did Rory McIlroy take home?",
    "text": "It was thrilling a final round at the Masters as it almost promises every year. But in the 90th edition, Rory McIlroy came out on top, making history in the process.After a roller coaster final round, McIlroy won the Masters for the second straight year, carding a 276, one shot better than Scottie Scheffler. He is the fourth man to win the tournament in consecutive years, joining Jack Nicklaus, Nick Faldo and Tiger Woods.AdvertisementWho won the 2026 Masters?Rory McIlroy won the 2026 Masters, becoming the fourth man in Masters history to win consecutive Green Jackets. He joins Tiger Woods, Nick Faldo and Jack Nicklaus on that Illustrious list.2026 Masters champion winners purseRory McIlroy brought home $4.5 million for winning the tournament, the largest payout in history for the Masters. This figure eclipses last year's record winner's purse, $4.2 million.Masters players who miss the cut still get paidProfessional golfers who miss the cut at the Masters are paid $25,000 each.Do amateurs playing in Masters 2026 get paid?Amateurs who play in the Masters Tournament do not receive monetary prizes.AdvertisementThe amateur with the lowest score at the end of the Tournament wins a silver cup. However, for the second year in a row, no amateur made the cut at the Masters.2025 Masters earnings payouts(Top 10 finishers and payouts)1. Rory McIlroy: $4,500,0002. Scottie Scheffler: $2,430,000T3. Tyrrell Hatton: $1,080,000T3. Russell Henley: $1,080,000T3. Justin Rose: $1,080,000T3. Cameron Young: $1,080,000T7. Collin Morikawa: $725,625T7. Sam Burns: $725,625T9. Max Homa: $630,000T9. Xander Schauffele: $630,000This article originally appeared on Florida Times-Union: 2026 Masters purse, payout: Prize money details for Augusta National",
